  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCCA + Flagship Initiative Supporting climate smart agriculture for small holders in Mauritius</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to increase the resilience to climate change of small holders in the Republic of Mauritius thus contributing to sustainable livelihoods. The specific objective is to increase the capacity of vulnerable non-sugar small holders as well as other key stakeholders towards developing and sustaining climate smart agriculture in the Republic of Mauritius.</narrative>
  </description>
